<title>USA: Integon's James Lambie resigns as CEO.</title>
<headline>Integon's James Lambie resigns as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WINSTON-SALEM, N.C. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auto insurer Integon Corp said Monday that James Lambie has resigned as chief executive but will continue as president &quot;for the next several months.&quot;</p>
</text>
